5. **The page's stand check** — `tests/blitz-tests/tests/stand_order_served.rs`, one target, its `//!` doc naming the
   behaviour, `mod session_common;`, both layout modes, failure messages naming a mode and an index only (keeps arch
   S1–S2, tests S1, S3, S4, obs S1, S3, security S3). A session `Session::start("order", || stand::boot_order(…))`:
   - boot: the snapshot text under `SNAPSHOT_TEXT_BUDGET`, `lint` 0 findings, `unkeyed_actionable` empty;
   - `click order-submit` at `0`: one `error` item, `level` error, `boundary` `own`, `message` `QUANTITY_RULE`, its
     `chain` as measured, tied to `order-submit`, its owner and `click`; the diff holds `order-failed` and `order-retry`
     added and `order-submit` removed;
   - `click order-retry`: no `caused` key; `order-submit` back;
   - `type order-quantity "5"`, `click order-submit`: a second `error` item, a new mark after the reset;
   - `click order-retry`, `type order-quantity "12"`, `press tab` to `order-submit`, `press enter`: one `log` item,
     `level` info, `source` app, `target` the page module's path, `message` `ORDER_PLACED`, `fields` empty, tied to
     `order-submit` and `click`; `order-status` reads "Order placed";
   - `click order-export`: one `panic` item, `level` error, `message` `EXPORT_UNBUILT`, `file` ending in `order.rs`
     under the page's directory read separator-agnostically and `line` `EXPORT_PANIC_LINE`, tied to `order-export`;
     after it a `click order-retry`-free step still acts (the session answers);
   - every written line of those answers holds no `[redacted]`;
   - the same `caused` crosses `serve_mcp` in process, decoded whole through the shared helper (test-plan
     integration-test-strategy/decision/mcp-result-decoded-whole);
   - a recorded session of those steps replays green through `Check::replay` (unix-gated item by item, tests S2).
   The measured literals (the chain, the owner id) are pinned as literals (tests S3, decision/expected-value-pinned-as-literal).

- **Dependencies:** added `tracing = { workspace = true }` to `seven_guis` (`examples/seven_guis/Cargo.toml`); `Cargo.lock`
  gains one edge, `"tracing"` in the `seven_guis` entry — no new package (tracing 0.1 already locked for the workspace;
  `cargo update --offline -p seven_guis`: `Locking 0 packages`).

- **Schema / config:** the cold-agent verdict gains `caused_by_kind`, an object of the three closed words to counts;
  `capability-unused`'s set gains it. No driver schema, verb, argument, cause, session error, exit, node key, log field or
  span changed. Scrub sets unchanged; the page's texts write no field.

- **Operator pass:** run by hand in plan order (`evidence/operator-pass.md`):
  - entry 13 hygiene — `hygiene: clean — read 209 (runs 199 · evidence 2 · inputs 8) …`, exit 0;
  - the pre-CI commit `ab8e18b89`; entry 14 — `ci-leg.sh fast` exit 0 (250 `test result: ok`, `Ran 125 tests … OK`),
    the clean-tree guard and the push `e4c8e3047..ab8e18b89`, exit 0;
  - entry 15 on `ab8e18b89` — CI#44308500657 `verdict: red`, `Test (android)` failure (job 134823305568): `seven_guis`
    (lib) does not compile for `aarch64-linux-android` — E0107 · E0277 · E0308 at `examples/seven_guis/src/tasks/order.rs:90`
    and `:92`, the `Result` in scope there being manganis 0.7.10's android-only `pub type Result<T> =
    std::result::Result<T, jni::errors::Error>` reached through `dioxus_native::prelude`'s glob; `Test (ios)` cancelled
    (no runner, job 134823305604); the other 15 jobs success; read whole after the run completed, on the operator's
    second directive;
  - the fix commit `bc9be0469`, on the operator's word; `fast` exit 0 again; the push `ab8e18b89..bc9be0469`;
  - entry 15 on `bc9be0469` — CI#44317201082: `Test (android)` (job 134855048119) and `Test (ios)` success; `Test
    (macos)` no runner and cancelled at attempts 1-4 (three re-runs, on the directive) and 5 (the operator's own);
    attempt 6 (the operator's) ran on a runner, success (job 134914162944); `ci.py conclusion --sha
    bc9be04693e7a546a2fc7528cdb3e720f99e32d5 --wait 2700`: `verdict: green · checks 17/17 · attempt 6 · wall 7981 s ·
    runs CI#44317201082 completed/success`;
  - the pass's end: **fixed** — green on `bc9be0469`.
